ON-PREM -> AWS PRIVATE EC2
==========================
* Traffic leaves on-prem router

* Encrypted via IPsec tunnel

* Reaches AWS Transit Gateway

* Routed to target VPC attachment

* Delivered to private EC2 instance

AWS -> INTERNET (OUTBOUND ONLY)
===============================
# Private EC2 sends traffic to NAT Gateway

# NAT Gateway routes traffic via Internet Gateway

# No inbound internet access to private subnets
